#4000
The Hill Road~
   A rutted cart road climbs north out of the plains into low, bare hills.
The dwarves once hauled ore down this road to the markets of the east; now
the ruts are full of weeds and nobody comes this way who can help it. Far
off to the northeast the first peaks of a long mountain chain rise grey
against the sky. The road runs north into the hills and south back to the
plains.
~
